{"step_index":383,"source":"SYSTEM","type":"CHECKPOINT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-21T22:43:59Z","content":"{{ CHECKPOINT 8 }}\n **The earlier parts of this conversation have been truncated due to its long length. The following content summarizes the truncated context so that you may continue your work. **\n\n\n# User Requests\nThe following were user requests from the truncated conversation in chronological order:\n1. (venv) PS D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy> python fast_main.py --shortages \"D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy\\0913.xlsx\" --warehouses \"D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy\\transform-result-f5254d99-e492-48f1-8a36-1688af690395.json\" \"D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy\\transform-result-5adb330b-3b30-4894-9d61-d31e1197080a.json\"\r\n\r\n[Settings]\r\n  Model: gpt-4o-mini (via MSEMAX Local API)\r\n  Engine: Fast Hybrid (TF-IDF + LLM)\r\n\r\n============================================================\r\n[*] Processing Shortages files\r\n============================================================\r\n\r\n============================================================\r\n[*] Processing Shortages files (1 file(s))\r\n============================================================\r\n\r\n  -> File: 0913.xlsx (Type: .xlsx)\r\n  -> Reading Excel file: 0913.xlsx\r\n  -> Active sheet: ورقة2\r\n  -> Header row: 6 -> ['أسم العميل', 'أسم الصنف', 'التاريخ', 'الكمية']\r\n  -> Extracted 993 data rows\r\n  -> Auto-detected drug name column: أسم الصنف\r\n  -> Extracte\n<truncated 2639 bytes>\n2. تمام ممكن لما نبدأ نشتغل علي الملفات كلها يضبط بس كده عندي حاجة بسيطة، وهي في \"يحتاج إلى مراجعة\"، يبقى مثلا في علامة صح أو غلط، هو هيراجع، فلو لقى الصنف تمام، هيوديه على الشيت تبعه، تبع الـ PDF. طب لو لقى الحاجة مش تمام، هيروح لـ \"لم يعثر عليه\". فاهم قصدي؟ عايز أضبطها دي كمان. \n3. مش عارف، الفكرة إن هو محتاجه Excel. طب ما تجرب تعمله Macro؟ أعتقد الماكرو مش صعب قوي يعني. \n4. الموضوع هيبقى أوتومات\n<truncated 18542 bytes>\nQuick similarity score between two drug names\\n  - Returns 0.0 to 1.0\\n\\n## 3. src/match/gemini_match.py\\nGemini-based intelligent drug matching:\\n\\n```python\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"Use Gemini to resolve ambiguous drug name matches.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n```\\n\\nFunctions:\\n- match_with_gemini(shortage_name: str, candidates: list[dict], api_key: str, model: str = 'gemini-2.5-flash') -> dict:\\n  - Takes a shortage drug name and list of candidate items from a warehouse\\n  - Each candidate has: item_name_raw, source (filename)\\n  - Sends to Gemini with a carefully crafted prompt\\n  - The prompt asks Gemini to:\\n    1. Compare the shortage drug name with each candidate\\n    2. Consider: drug name, concentration/strength, dosage form, pack size\\n    3. Return a JSON with: matched_index (or -1 if no match), confidence (high/medium/low), reason\\n    4. If there's a clear match (same drug, same strength, same form) -> match\\n    5. If drug name matches but strength/form differs -> no match\\n    6. If ambiguous -> return confidence=low\\n  - Uses google.genai client (the new SDK)\\n  - Uses structured output (response_mime_type='application/json')\\n  - Returns: {\\\"matched\\\": bool, \\\"matched_item\\\": str|None, \\\"confidence\\\": str, \\\"reason\\\": str}\\n\\n- batch_match_with_gemini(shortage_items: list[str], warehouse_items: list[str], api_key: str, model: str = 'gemini-2.5-flash') -> list[dict]:\\n  - For efficiency, batch multiple shortage items in one Gemini call\\n  - Send up to 10 shortage items at a time with the full warehouse list\\n  - Ask Gemini to match each shortage item to the best warehouse item\\n  - Returns list of match results\\n\\nThe Gemini prompt should be in Arabic and very specific:\\n- Focus on: اسم الصنف, التركيز, الشكل الدوائي, حجم العبوة\\n- Spelling differences are OK (the same drug with typos)\\n- Different concentrations = different product (NOT a match)\\n- Different forms\n---\nThe checkpoint summary has been truncated due to hitting max length. Please see the conversation log file for the full conversation.","truncated_fields":["content"]}
